      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然知道不应该，\n但人们还是容易通过外表判断事物……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕū",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D713677E590534E0D5E948BE5FF0C000A4F464EBA4EEC8FD8662F5BB96613901A8FC759168868522465AD4E8B726920262026001000020114016B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你是能看透本质的人吗？\n能的话，请和我对战吧。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n因为我的宝可梦们\n强得让人发愁啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕū",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60662F80FD770B900F672C8D2876844EBA5417FF1F000A80FD76848BDDFF0C8BF7548C62115BF962185427300200100001BE01000A56E04E3A621176845B9D53EF68A64EEC000A5F3A5F978BA94EBA53D16101554AFF01001000020114016B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你要是准备好跟我打\n宝可梦对战了，就来找我吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕū",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608981662F51C65907597D8DDF62116253000A5B9D53EF68A65BF962184E86FF0C5C316765627E621154273002001000020114016B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你要和我强得让人发愁的\n宝可梦们对战吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕū",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608981548C62115F3A5F978BA94EBA53D161017684000A5B9D53EF68A64EEC5BF962185417FF1F001000020114016B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对战！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF96218FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD8662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真是明智的判断。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n如果没有看透本质的自信，\n就应该避免无用之战。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕū",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F662F660E667A7684522465AD300200100001BE01000A5982679C6CA16709770B900F672C8D28768481EA4FE1FF0C000A5C315E948BE5907F514D65E075284E4B62183002001000020114016B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的宝可梦们强得让人发愁，\n看来，你有看透它们本质的自信咯？<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n太期待和你对战了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕū",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176845B9D53EF68A64EEC5F3A5F978BA94EBA53D16101FF0C000A770B6765FF0C4F606709770B900F5B834EEC672C8D28768481EA4FE154AFFF1F00100001BE00000A592A671F5F85548C4F605BF962184E86FF01001000020114016B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "别看我的宝可梦们这样，\n它们可都是身经百战的猛士，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n所以都遮掩不住各自的强大呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕū",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "522B770B621176845B9D53EF68A64EEC8FD96837FF0C000A5B834EEC53EF90FD662F8EAB7ECF767E62187684731B58EBFF0C00100001BE00000A62404EE590FD906E63A94E0D4F4F540481EA76845F3A592754623002001000020114016B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "用世人都说可爱的外表\n让对手放松警惕，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n同时用动真格的招式击溃对手……！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕū",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75284E164EBA90FD8BF453EF7231768459168868000A8BA95BF9624B653E677E8B6660D5FF0C00100001BE00000A540C65F6752852A8771F683C768462DB5F0F51FB6E835BF9624B20262026FF01001000020114016B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "面对全力以赴的对手，\n这种刁钻的策略也失效了啊。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n毕竟，强大的本质\n被看透了呀。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕū",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "97625BF95168529B4EE58D7476845BF9624BFF0C000A8FD979CD520194BB76847B5675654E5F593165484E86554A300200100001BE01000A6BD57ADFFF0C5F3A59277684672C8D28000A88AB770B900F4E8654403002001000020114016B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽说不要通过外表判断事物，\n但内心是看不见的，也不为人所知。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n所以，我们今后也要\n继续利用别人的疏忽大意哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕū",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
